<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRANCE BEAT BELGIUM 3-2 IN FED CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE BEAT BELGIUM 3-2 IN FED CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>NICE 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Belgium 3-2 in their Fed Cup semifinal on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) beat Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat/Fusai beat Els Callens/Laurence Courtois (Belgium) 3-6 6-2 7-5</p>
</text>
